{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123438","id":4511103258,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDOH5Gg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123438","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123438.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123438.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123438","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123438/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123438/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123438/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5f90334c7659281c467abfa15e01b7a3cfaa101e","number":123438,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[3.x] Fix AudioServer bus index cache updates","user":{"login":"hzagaming","id":171329875,"node_id":"U_kgDOCjZJUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171329875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming","html_url":"https://github.com/hzagaming","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hzagaming/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #123409.\n\nIn Godot 3.x, `AudioServer::Bus::index_cache` is normally refreshed from\n`_mix_step()`. If the bus layout changes between mix steps, however,\n`thread_find_bus_index()` can observe an uninitialized or stale cached index.\n\nThis can affect buses which are added, removed, resized, or moved while the\nengine is already running.\n\n## Additional information\n\nThis adds a small `_update_bus_index_cache()` helper and refreshes cached bus\nindices immediately after operations which change the bus vector:\n\n- `set_bus_count()`\n- `add_bus()`\n- `remove_bus()`\n- `move_bus()`\n\nThe existing refresh in `_mix_step()` is intentionally kept as a defensive\nsynchronization point.\n\nTesting performed on macOS:\n\n- Godot 3.x compiled successfully with `tools=no target=debug`\n- `git diff --check` passes\n- Only `servers/audio_server.cpp` and `servers/audio_server.h` are changed\n\nAI usage disclosure: ChatGPT was used to help analyze the reported issue,\ntrace the affected bus-layout mutation paths, prepare the patch, and construct\nthe local validation workflow. The resulting C++ changes were validated by\nbuilding the Godot 3.x engine locally before opening this PR.\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":7806203,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4Adxz7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/14","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/14","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/14/labels","number":14,"state":"open","title":"3.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for